      "abstract": "This reference report demonstrates PDF extraction, table recovery, scientific entity recognition, document search\nand evidence bridging. It discusses PTGS2, ADORA2A, SIRT1 and PIK3CA with illustrative IC50, Ki and EC50\nmeasurements.",
