      "methods": "Ten reference compounds were assessed in a simulated biochemical screening workflow. Values are illustrative\nand are included only to populate the BioIntel AI demonstration workspace.\nCompound Target Endpoint Value (nM) Review\nAspirin reference PTGS2 IC50 125 Reviewed\nCaffeine reference ADORA2A Ki 820 Reviewed\nAdenosine reference ADORA2A Ki 32 Reviewed\nWarfarin reference VKORC1 IC50 18 Reviewed\nQuercetin reference PIK3CA IC50 950 Reviewed",
